# 可读版 control（审包用，不是构建输入）。
#
# 真正的 package control 由 cmake/FCPPackaging.cmake 里的 CPACK_* 变量生成；
# 改一边记得改另一边。长描述文本的唯一真源是 packaging/debian/description。
#
# 已安装文件（6 项，packaging/debian 与 cmake/FCPPackaging.cmake 的 install()）:
#   /usr/bin/fcp-proxy-server
#   /usr/bin/fcp-proxy-client
#   /usr/lib/systemd/system/fcp-proxy.service
#   /etc/fcp/fcp-proxy.env                (conffile)
#   /usr/share/doc/fcp-proxy/*.md         (docs/*.md + VERSION)
#   /usr/share/doc/fcp-proxy/copyright
Package: fcp-proxy
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: libstdc++6 (>= 11), libc6 (>= 2.35)
Recommends: ca-certificates
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Description: FCP proxy server and client (UDP tunnel with adaptive FEC)
 See packaging/debian/description for the long description.
